        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Samuel Alito, George W. Bush\n- Organizations: Supreme Court of the United States\n- Cases: Hawaii v. Office of Hawaiian Affairs\n- Topics: judicial opinions, nominations, state land sale authority\n\nFacts:\n- Samuel Anthony Alito Jr. was born on April 1, 1950.\n- President George W. Bush nominated Samuel Alito to the Supreme Court of the United States.\n- Samuel Alito has served on the Supreme Court of the United States since January 31, 2006.\n- In Hawaii v. Office of Hawaiian Affairs, the Court issued a unanimous opinion by Justice Samuel Alito.\n- In Hawaii v. Office of Hawaiian Affairs, the Court ruled that the state had the power to sell the lands free of encumbrances.",
